#~ msgid "Even so..."
#~ msgstr "Yine de..."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Those are brave words that I would not have expected from you, Afalas."
#~ msgstr "Bunlar sizden beklenmeyecek kadar cesur sözler, Afalas."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "All things end one way or another. Alas, I would have liked to see my "
