#~ msgstr "Vestin Muhafızı"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Finally, we have returned home! The undead and bandits are both defeated "
#~ "and it seems that the townsfolk have already begun to rebuild. Perhaps "
#~ "now there will be peace in Westin. You have our thanks, Lady Ethiliel. We "
#~ "could not have accomplished this feat without you."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Sonunda eve geri döndük! Yarı ölüler ve haydutlar yenildi. Görünüşe göre "
